#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Optional, single-file Chrono tracking component (API schema 1).

Public API: attach_tracking(input_path, output_dir=..., public_base_url=...).
Importing this file needs only Python's standard library. Inference runs in a
bounded child process; weights are external, hash-checked assets. The embedded
base engine is byte-for-byte V57, with separately pinned source/geometry
recovery helpers. Model weights and the original strain law are unchanged;
this candidate is not a new model or a clinical accuracy release.
Upstream CC BY-NC 4.0 and Apache 2.0 notices remain in the embedded engine.
"""
